                                "sense_id": "17d18313-eaf7-349b-94a8-21faf91cccc2",
                                "text": "In the community of their desire to be loved and wanted, they were tragic heroes. And yet what could she do? How could she bring such people the love they needed, and how unbetray the dead?"
